google chrome on windowsXP and in gmail I am typing up an email.  Supposing
the reply below has a word that I don't know (in fact, I'm curious about
what your name means).  I'm looking at GD's "popup definition" feature.  How
does it work?  I've enabled it under preferences and I can't get it to pop
up the definition window.

I follow the same steps in notepad and it works fine.  Do I need to do
something special to make it work with google chrome?

